  {
   "i": 1,
   "tipo": "CLASE",
   "titulo": "Lista de materiales",
   "html": "<div class=\"contentWrapper-0-4-670\"><div class=\"contentEditable-0-4-671 contentEditable-d4-0-4-944 root-0-4-675 vmIc3WzjxMkUf+6rJDBJLA==\" contenteditable=\"true\" id=\"editor-content-editable\" role=\"textbox\" spellcheck=\"true\" style=\"user-select: text; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\" data-lexical-editor=\"true\"><h3 class=\"editor-heading editor-h3\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Materiales para el workshop </strong><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">🐶 </span></h3><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Antes de empezar a pintar a tu perrito, asegúrate de tener todo listo para disfrutar al máximo el workshop 🎨💖</span></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Aquí te dejamos la lista de materiales que vas a necesitar:</span></p><ul class=\"editor-ul-depth-1\"><li value=\"1\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Funda de celular, papel para acrílico o lienzo pequeño</span></li><li value=\"2\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Pinturas acrílicas (los colores los veremos durante el proceso)</span></li><li value=\"3\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Pincel de punta redonda #4 o similar</span></li><li value=\"4\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Godete para mezclar tus colores</span></li><li value=\"5\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Papel o trapito para secar tus pinceles</span></li><li value=\"6\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Vasito con agua</span></li></ul><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Prepara tu espacio con calma, ponte cómod@… ¡y nos vemos en la siguiente lección para empezar a pintar! 🖌️✨</span></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\"><br></p></div><div class=\"tableCellActionButtonContainer-0-4-732\"></div><div class=\"blockTargetLine-0-4-760\"></div><div id=\"block-actions\" class=\"blockActionsMenu-0-4-754\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translate(-10000px, -10000px);\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"root-0-4-59 root-d10-0-4-966 blockAddAction-0-4-755\" data-testid=\"block-add-action-button\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-testid=\"DiscoIcon.add\" class=\"jqfzDtVhV-Wy18kyF1pugA== ntq8dOow+CpGfwq8FqQTwQ==\" style=\"--icon-width: 16px; --icon-height: 24px; --icon-color: var(--groovy-icon); --mt: 0; --mr: 0; --mb: 0; --ml: 0; --pt: 0; --pr: 0; --pb: 0; --pl: 0;\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M6 12h12M12 18V6\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"button\" draggable=\"true\" class=\"blockDragAction-0-4-759\" data-testid=\"BlockOptionsActionPlugin.DraggableBlock\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-testid=\"DiscoIcon.reorder\" class=\"jqfzDtVhV-Wy18kyF1pugA== ntq8dOow+CpGfwq8FqQTwQ==\" style=\"--icon-width: 16px; --icon-height: 24px; --icon-color: var(--groovy-icon); --mt: 0; --mr: 0; --mb: 0; --ml: 0; --pt: 0; --pr: 0; --pb: 0; --pl: 0;\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M8 6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M8 13a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M8 20a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 13a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 20a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M8 6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M8 13a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M8 20a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 13a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 20a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div>",
