  {
   "i": 2,
   "tipo": "CLASE",
   "titulo": "¡Workshop pintando a Lolo!",
   "html": "<div class=\"contentWrapper-0-4-670\"><div class=\"contentEditable-0-4-671 contentEditable-d7-0-4-1028 root-0-4-675 vmIc3WzjxMkUf+6rJDBJLA==\" contenteditable=\"true\" id=\"editor-content-editable\" role=\"textbox\" spellcheck=\"true\" style=\"user-select: text; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\" data-lexical-editor=\"true\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Aquí nos enfocamos en la técnica para realizar perritos oscuros y de pelo corto.</span></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\"><br></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Puntos clave:</span></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">🖌️ Hacer luces naturales</span></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">🖌️ Crear textura peludita sin necesidad de cubrir todo el perrito</span></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\"><br></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">¡Este workshop fue en vivo! Y gracias a la técnica de capas logramos un súper resultado y en tiempo récord. </span></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\"><br></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">¿Te animas a intentarlo?</span></p></div><div class=\"tableCellActionButtonContainer-0-4-732\"></div><div class=\"blockTargetLine-0-4-760\"></div><div id=\"block-actions\" class=\"blockActionsMenu-0-4-754\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translate(-10000px, -10000px);\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"root-0-4-59 root-d12-0-4-1050 blockAddAction-0-4-755\" data-testid=\"block-add-action-button\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-testid=\"DiscoIcon.add\" class=\"jqfzDtVhV-Wy18kyF1pugA== ntq8dOow+CpGfwq8FqQTwQ==\" style=\"--icon-width: 16px; --icon-height: 24px; --icon-color: var(--groovy-icon); --mt: 0; --mr: 0; --mb: 0; --ml: 0; -